flowchart TD
  REF[Gate B: active packet sync equivalence] --> CACHE[d0 detector-cache equivalence]
  CACHE --> P{Pilot: pair 26 and 48}
  P --> L[Delay Local Track]
  P --> H[Delay Homography]
  P --> I[Delay ID state]
  P --> S[Delay Supplement]
  L --> LM[Miss deadline: skip cross-view frame]
  H --> HM[Hold newest arrived H]
  I --> IM[Apply versioned remap only to live future tracks]
  S --> SM[Expire stale frame supplement]
  LM --> C[Measure MDA, MOTA, IDF1, IDSW and packet actions]
  HM --> C
  IM --> C
  SM --> C
  C --> X[H+ID, ID+S, H+ID+S, all-channel interactions]
  X --> G{Measurement and repeat gates pass?}
  G -->|yes| F[Formal: 14 test pairs]
  G -->|no| D[Repair async semantics; no boundary claim]
  F --> R{Independent effect or cascade?}
  R -->|single channel| A[Report channel boundary]
  R -->|combined loss exceeds singles| B[Report MIA state cascade]
